# Expected firmware and software versions for lsttstrix (Strix Halo, gfx1151).
#
# This repository is public: record a value only if it is a public release and
# is listed in ../public-releases.txt. System BIOS and BMC firmware are; the
# amdgpu driver is an internal build, so EXPECT_AMDGPU stays empty. An empty
# value is reported but not enforced.
# Bump a value in its own PR once the machine has been updated: a mismatch
# fails CI, which is how an undocumented change gets noticed.
# Quote values that contain spaces.

EXPECT_BIOS=
EXPECT_BMC=
EXPECT_AMDGPU=
